From 99a007ab2906838886caac830bea0500f2f36268 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:59:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(nightly): install dependencies before admit-fleet
 verifies stage receipts

The admit-fleet job checked out the source and ran
scripts/staged-fleet-inventory.mjs on the runner's default Node with no
node_modules. That script validates the stage receipt with ajv, a locked
devDependency, so the first Nightly to reach this leg (run 33681710652)
died with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND before verifying a single subject. Its
sibling jobs already pin Node from .nvmrc and run dependencies:ci; this
job now does the same before it downloads the portable stage artifact.

Closes #1334.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Mqw74Bp4SiuWmHpMs7WYrs
---
 .github/workflows/nightly-fleet-staging.yml | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/nightly-fleet-staging.yml b/.github/workflows/nightly-fleet-staging.yml
index 23546da9..daf8b016 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/nightly-fleet-staging.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/nightly-fleet-staging.yml
@@ -82,6 +82,13 @@ jobs:
     steps:
       - uses: actions/checkout@3d3c42e5aac5ba805825da76410c181273ba90b1 # v7.0.1
         with: { ref: "${{ needs.fleet-plan.outputs.source_sha }}", persist-credentials: false }
+      # `staged-fleet-inventory.mjs` validates the stage receipt with ajv, so
+      # this job needs the pinned Node and the locked dependencies like its
+      # siblings; on the runner's default Node with no node_modules the first
+      # Nightly to reach this leg died with ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND (ajv).
+      - uses: actions/setup-node@820762786026740c76f36085b0efc47a31fe5020 # v7.0.0
+        with: { node-version-file: .nvmrc }
+      - run: npm run dependencies:ci
       - uses: actions/download-artifact@d3f86a106a0bac45b974a628896c90dbdf5c8093 # v4.3.0
         with: { name: "nightly-fleet-portable-${{ github.run_id }}", path: staged }
       - name: Verify every attested subject with exact workflow identity
-- 
